#: scenario8:scenario8_FDDBB141_2134_49A1_9C9E_D50AB0577073
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8c2c16b47a9962ca1c7cbe55adf1ab2830dc3ae5217390bf7b9c7ded97030799
